<IPA_transcription>man̩ sɔm 'skʉlə stelə 'hɑimə                  de vaɾ n gɑŋ n 'mɑn sɔm vɑːɾ sɔː gɾɛtn̩ ɔ vɪl ɔ vɪl ɔ 'ɑldɾiː  'syːntəs hɑn ɑ kʰuːnɑ  juːɾə nɔk I 'hʉːsə sɔ kɔm hɑn heːm n kʰv̥el ɔ vɑː veldiː sʉɾ çæːɾə fɑɾ væːɾ ikə sɑ von sɑː 'kʰuːnɑ….</IPA_transcription>
<gloss>The Man Who Would Do The Housekeeping    Once upon a time there was a man who was so cross and wild, and never thought that his wife did enough in the house.  Then he came home one evening and was very grouchy.  Dear Pa, don't be so angry, said the wife...</gloss>
